# OPUS-TYPED-BINDING-20260930-20, next_core_tasks.md §3 item 207: an Other bound to a Model b whose body writes b\value: the
# admission by b's uses refuses it at translation, located at the binding (without it, 9 would go into an Other).
Model:
    size_t: value 1U
end: Model

Other:
    int: p 1
    int: q 2
end: Other

int: out 0
Other: o
Model: b o
b\value: 9U
out: 7
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: out; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
